  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO) Funds in Trust (FIT) Phase 4 builds on previous programs to further enhance intellectual property (IP) systems in Indo-Pacific developing countries and least developed countries. IP Australia manages this investment on behalf of Australia in consultation with DFAT.</narrative>
